FAQs:

Q: Will my clients see your name?
A: No. The platform is completely "White Label". Your clients only see your brand, your domain, and your support links.

Q: How much can I make?
A: You buy credits at wholesale prices and sell them at retail prices. Most partners make a 50-200% margin on top of subscription fees.

Q: Who helps my clients?
A: You provide first-line support to your clients, and we provide back-end technical support to you.

Q: Can I have my own resellers?
A: Yes, our Elite plan allows you to create "Sub-Resellers" who sell under your brand.

Q: How do I get paid?
A: The system integrates with Stripe. When your clients pay, the money goes directly into your bank account.

Q: Is there a long-term contract?
A: No, our plans are month-to-month. You can cancel at any time.

Q: Do I need a server?
A: No, we host everything on our high-speed, secure global infrastructure.

Q: Do you add new features?
A: Yes, we are constantly updating the platform. New features appear in your dashboard automatically at no extra cost.

Q: What does the "Your Brand" capability include?
A: Your Logo, Your Domain, Your Colors. The benefit: build your own asset.

Q: What does the "Set Your Prices" capability include?
A: Buy wholesale, sell retail. The benefit: control your margins.